<h3>✅ What Is RedotPay?</h3>
<p><strong>RedotPay</strong> is a cryptocurrency payment app based in Hong Kong that works as both a crypto wallet and a <strong>prepaid Visa card</strong>. You top up your balance with cryptocurrencies like BTC, ETH, USDT, USDC or BNB and spend directly from the app at merchants worldwide, both online and in person.</p>
<p>The idea is simple: instead of selling your crypto on an exchange to pay for things, you <strong>convert and spend on the go</strong> directly from your wallet. The card is compatible with Apple Pay and Google Pay, so you can pay with your phone just like with a traditional card.</p>

<h3>💳 Virtual and Physical Cards</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Virtual card</strong> — instant activation, ideal for online purchases. <strong>$10 USD one-time fee</strong>.</li>
  <li><strong>Physical card</strong> — Visa card with chip and contactless, with your name embossed. <strong>$100 USD one-time fee</strong>.</li>
  <li><strong>$0 monthly fee and $0 annual fee</strong> — no maintenance costs.</li>
  <li>You can <strong>freeze and unfreeze</strong> the card from the app and set spending limits.</li>
  <li>Compatible with <strong>Apple Pay and Google Pay</strong> to pay with your phone.</li>
</ul>

<h3>🌐 Supported Cryptocurrencies and Networks</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>BTC, ETH, USDT, USDC and BNB</strong> among the main supported assets.</li>
  <li><strong>Multi-chain</strong> support: Tron (TRC-20), Ethereum (ERC-20), BNB Smart Chain, Polygon and Arbitrum.</li>
  <li>Stablecoins like USDT and USDC are ideal for spending without worrying about volatility.</li>
